{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast","id":1467890,"title":"Any Interest in an Exalted Setting Discussion Podcast?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-15T10:56:56-08:00","id":1467890,"title":"Any Interest in an Exalted Setting Discussion Podcast?","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I love the story hooks that Exalted throws out there, but often find myself a little stymied for the details until I talk things through and bounce ideas around a bit. In a though of &quot;I'd like this, would other people?&quot;, would anyone here listen to a podcast where we take Exalted story seeds and run with them to draft outlines for characters, stories, chronicles etc? I'd also do my best to present the ideas in the podcast in written form as well, as I don't like hearing things and then not having them to hand when I come to write stuff later.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm not sure that it would necessarily get to the point of stats and mechanics, but we could feel in that direction if necessary.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I have no idea if this could actually happen yet, but are people interested in the idea? Any thoughts on how it could be done/what format? Any other comments or remarks whatsoever?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I want to stress this is a possible project. Please don't hate me if this doesn't happen.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:55:31-08:00","id":1467907,"title":"","content":"I think it would be an interesting idea. I'd offer a suggestion that what you could also do would be to have a podcast where one of the other hosts has no clue about anything to do with Exalted, and then you explore and introduce the lore to them. It's a popular concept for podcast shows (such as Kingdom Smarts, etc.) that I think would also work here.<br /> <br /> Also, short episodes, an hour at most. As someone who listens to podcasts quite often, I don't really remember or take in anything from the 2 hour+ ones because I'm not given any downtime to process all of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:52:44-08:00","id":1467926,"title":"","content":"I think it's a great idea and would love to be a part of it if given the chance.<br /> <br /> I think the best format would be podcast. It could be thrown up on Youtube (or Youtube music) as well, but I think for format would best be suited for podcast.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T18:46:51-08:00","id":1467964,"title":"","content":"Systematic understanding of everything is finished, Fall of Jiara is ending, and Exaltwitch academy does not appeal to me. I would absolutely love a new Exalted podcast","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T20:53:27-08:00","id":1467971,"title":"","content":"I listen to all Exalted podcasts I can get my hands on and would love to see more discussion episodes instead of APs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T04:43:00-08:00","id":1467989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Critian Caceorte</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1467907#post1467907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd offer a suggestion that what you could also do would be to have a podcast where one of the other hosts has no clue about anything to do with Exalted, and then you explore and introduce the lore to them. It's a popular concept for podcast shows (such as Kingdom Smarts, etc.) that I think would also work here.</div> </div> </div> </div>This could work nicely, but I'm not 100% sure on it at the moment. Systematic Understanding of Everything does this very well, with a &quot;professional ignorant&quot; in one of the hosts. I guess the new podcast could dig in deeper into the settings (1 episode on Nexus rather than 1 episode on the Scavenger Lands), but I'm a little wary of doing something that has been done before to an extent. I can certainly see this being fun, but I'm also not the most knowledgeable in Exalted lore myself, so may not be able to answer questions adequately on the fly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T05:59:33-08:00","id":1467992,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in written transcripts. I do not have an easy time processing spoken language, especially not recordings where I can't ask people to speak slower or easily back up to catch what I missed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T07:11:29-08:00","id":1467999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1467989#post1467989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This could work nicely, but I'm not 100% sure on it at the moment. Systematic Understanding of Everything does this very well, with a &quot;professional ignorant&quot; in one of the hosts. I guess the new podcast could dig in deeper into the settings (1 episode on Nexus rather than 1 episode on the Scavenger Lands), but I'm a little wary of doing something that has been done before to an extent. I can certainly see this being fun, but I'm also not the most knowledgeable in Exalted lore myself, so may not be able to answer questions adequately on the fly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say give either or a shot. I mean yes you'd be going over some old material with a new perspective and zoom in really close to others.<br /> <br /> Hell, maybe even examining a region there could be a special episode to see people can craft an organization/town in a spontaneous manner.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T15:20:37-08:00","id":1468058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1467992#post1467992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be interested in written transcripts. I do not have an easy time processing spoken language, especially not recordings where I can't ask people to speak slower or easily back up to catch what I missed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I would always provide transcripts. Part of me is wondering whether this sort of project is more amenable to being more thoroughly adapted into longer form written content as well. I guess I'd have to see how much work it is, given any time I have avaliable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T06:43:57-08:00","id":1468591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1467964#post1467964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Systematic understanding of everything is finished, Fall of Jiara is ending, and Exaltwitch academy does not appeal to me. I would absolutely love a new Exalted podcast</div> </div> </div> </div>The RPG Blender is currently in an amazing AP run of Exalted (barring one early episode in which the Exalted combat system almost collapses under its own weight).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T06:52:00-08:00","id":1468592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast#post1467890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I love the story hooks that Exalted throws out there, but often find myself a little stymied for the details until I talk things through and bounce ideas around a bit. In a though of &quot;I'd like this, would other people?&quot;, would anyone here listen to a podcast where we take Exalted story seeds and run with them to draft outlines for characters, stories, chronicles etc? I'd also do my best to present the ideas in the podcast in written form as well, as I don't like hearing things and then not having them to hand when I come to write stuff later.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm not sure that it would necessarily get to the point of stats and mechanics, but we could feel in that direction if necessary.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I have no idea if this could actually happen yet, but are people interested in the idea? Any thoughts on how it could be done/what format? Any other comments or remarks whatsoever?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I want to stress this is a possible project. Please don't hate me if this doesn't happen.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe do a pilot and see if people are interested. I will definitely listen to one episode of anything Exalted, but if your voice or personality is grating, I will probably move on rather quickly, sorry to say.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T11:11:59-08:00","id":1468613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1468591#post1468591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The RPG Blender is currently in an amazing AP run of Exalted (barring one early episode in which the Exalted combat system almost collapses under its own weight).</div> </div> </div> </div>Will be taking a listen to that - always after more Exalted content myself.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1468592#post1468592\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe do a pilot and see if people are interested. I will definitely listen to one episode of anything Exalted, but if your voice or personality is grating, I will probably move on rather quickly, sorry to say.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's fair enough. I've bee told my voice is decent in my Elder Scrolls podcast, so I'd hope that the only thing to worry about is the content. That small, small thing...<br /> <br /> The biggest thing so far is finding a cohost with a schedule that I can have a regular schedule with. I'm in the UK, so getting regular crossover with many of the people in the Exalted community may be tricky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T13:02:11-08:00","id":1468625,"title":"","content":"This could help hammer out some times.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/meeting.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/meeting.html</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-26T10:59:46-08:00","id":1468925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1468591#post1468591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The RPG Blender is currently in an amazing AP run of Exalted (barring one early episode in which the Exalted combat system almost collapses under its own weight).</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you so much, I'll check it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-01T08:30:30-08:00","id":1469318,"title":"","content":"I'm on episode 5 of the RPG blender story. It is lots of fun but I find that their poor understanding of the rules and setting to be an annoyance. I eagerly look forward to their story guide rereading the combat rules. Then I will enjoy it even more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-03T08:58:37-08:00","id":1469497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1469318#post1469318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm on episode 5 of the RPG blender story. It is lots of fun but I find that their poor understanding of the rules and setting to be an annoyance. I eagerly look forward to their story guide rereading the combat rules. Then I will enjoy it even more.</div> </div> </div> </div>The single worst episode is when they fight <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">golems</div></div> </div> </div>, but it sounds like you are past that.<br /> <br /> I, for one, think that their superficial familiarity with the setting is refreshing. The players really marvel at stuff because they have seen nothing like it before. It reminded me that I take a lot of the setting for granted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-10T06:15:48-08:00","id":1470125,"title":"","content":"duplicate message and didn't see a way to delete it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-10T06:16:31-08:00","id":1470126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast#post1467890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I love the story hooks that Exalted throws out there, but often find myself a little stymied for the details until I talk things through and bounce ideas around a bit. In a though of &quot;I'd like this, would other people?&quot;, would anyone here listen to a podcast where we take Exalted story seeds and run with them to draft outlines for characters, stories, chronicles etc? I'd also do my best to present the ideas in the podcast in written form as well, as I don't like hearing things and then not having them to hand when I come to write stuff later.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm not sure that it would necessarily get to the point of stats and mechanics, but we could feel in that direction if necessary.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I have no idea if this could actually happen yet, but are people interested in the idea? Any thoughts on how it could be done/what format? Any other comments or remarks whatsoever?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I want to stress this is a possible project. Please don't hate me if this doesn't happen.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd love to see more podcast content for exalted<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-24T15:40:43-07:00","id":1477279,"title":"","content":"Just an update - this is happening. First 2 episodes' material is ready for launch, want to get the 3rd done before we hit &quot;go&quot; on this thing. That will be recorded next week, and then editing and website will all be prepped. Should be started in early March for the first season (will explain all that on the podcast itself).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T11:26:52-07:00","id":1477693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast?p=1477279#post1477279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just an update - this is happening. First 2 episodes' material is ready for launch, want to get the 3rd done before we hit &quot;go&quot; on this thing. That will be recorded next week, and then editing and website will all be prepped. Should be started in early March for the first season (will explain all that on the podcast itself).</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking forward to this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-07T05:17:36-07:00","id":1480361,"title":"","content":"The Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny podcast is now live!<br /> <br /> Each release, we're looking at a concept, character or (most often) a place within the Exalted setting, split into two. The first is an examination of the lore of that thing, and the second is how to use that thing in your games, finishing with 2 fleshed out story ideas discussed and (eventually) made available with full stats and mechanics on the show's website.<br /> <br /> Show website: <a href=\"https://www.wondrousatlas.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wondrousatlas.wordpress.com</a><br /> Anchor: <a href=\"https://anchor.fm/wondrous-atlas-of-creations-destiny\" target=\"_blank\">https://anchor.fm/wondrous-atlas-of-creations-destiny</a><br /> Spotify: <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/00kUymWSFkHbzamDk7Hohm\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/show/00kUymWSFkHbzamDk7Hohm</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T08:55:20-07:00","id":1488704,"title":"","content":"I'd love to listen to a good exalted podcast exploring the setting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T09:20:33-07:00","id":1488709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467890-any-interest-in-an-exalted-setting-discussion-podcast#post1467890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I love the story hooks that Exalted throws out there, but often find myself a little stymied for the details until I talk things through and bounce ideas around a bit. In a though of &quot;I'd like this, would other people?&quot;, would anyone here listen to a podcast where we take Exalted story seeds and run with them to draft outlines for characters, stories, chronicles etc? I'd also do my best to present the ideas in the podcast in written form as well, as I don't like hearing things and then not having them to hand when I come to write stuff later.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm not sure that it would necessarily get to the point of stats and mechanics, but we could feel in that direction if necessary.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I have no idea if this could actually happen yet, but are people interested in the idea? Any thoughts on how it could be done/what format? Any other comments or remarks whatsoever?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I want to stress this is a possible project. Please don't hate me if this doesn't happen.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd love to listen to a good exalted podcast exploring the setting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}